  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 38948bbc0f96de7498bb32b64efae4ec, type: 3}
  m_Name: Pilote -Mail Too many Promotion
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  title: Too many Promotion!
  character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8db74389b8c31914dbe8c9c4cf3c818b, type: 2}
  mailText: 'Good morning,


    It is to my understanding that you have already
    granted too many promotions. The Board is not happy about this.


    From now
    on, employees working fewer than seven hours will not be eligible for promotion.


    We
    will also give you access to the database so you can check that employees have
    not overestimated their abilities in their self-assessment report. You are instructed
    to put anyone who has in the Reeducation Program.'
